# probe (quest rework P6): storage <inventory|satchel> <n>, a container's size: before the login char_storage's column,
# after it a GM's player:changeContainerSize by the difference. Through The Gobbiebag Parts II and III (jeuno 28 and 29),
# whose template reads getContainerSize(INVENTORY) (reqsMet: exactly the part's start size; 43's and 73's first
# parameter) and getContainerSize(MOGSATCHEL) (73's finish grows a satchel the char has). Recorded on the Lua quests; the
# parts are C# ports now (GobbiebagQuest.cs), so the replay runs against the real ports and the probe can no longer be
# recorded.
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
storage inventory 35                    # Part II's start size (a fresh char has 30)
storage satchel 30                      # a Mog Satchel (a fresh char has none)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
item SquareOfRamLeather
item MythrilIngot
item SquareOfWoolCloth
item Turquoise
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # Part II available at 35: 43 (36, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trade Bluffnix SquareOfRamLeather x1 MythrilIngot x1 SquareOfWoolCloth x1 Turquoise x1 # 73 (41)
finish                                  # completed: the inventory 40, the satchel 35 (an ITEM_MAX each)
storage inventory 45                    # a GM: changeContainerSize(INVENTORY, 5)
trigger Bluffnix                        # Part III's start size is 40, not 45: no section
finish-if-event
storage inventory 40                    # a GM: changeContainerSize(INVENTORY, -5)
storage satchel 0                       # a GM: changeContainerSize(MOGSATCHEL, -35): no satchel
trigger Bluffnix                        # Part III available at 40: 43 (41, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
item SquareOfBlackTigerLeather          # a GM
item GoldIngot
item SquareOfVelvetCloth
item Painite
trade Bluffnix SquareOfBlackTigerLeather x1 GoldIngot x1 SquareOfVelvetCloth x1 Painite x1 # 73 (46)
finish                                  # completed: the inventory 45; no satchel, so no satchel change
